# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Select Blight 1 as Bogslither's Embrace's additional-cost branch.
# Forcing: Grizzly Bears is the only controlled creature eligible to receive the counter.
# AI behavior: The scripted human path has one spell target and one cost-payment creature.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = the spell and selected Blight payment resolve normally.
#   LOSE = the cast or payment path did not complete before the turn limit.
#   TIMEOUT = a cast-time, targeting, or cost prompt did not resume the game.
# Card roles:
#   Bogslither's Embrace — exposes the Blight-or-mana branch and exiles the target.
#   Grizzly Bears — receives the Blight counter.
#   Centaur Courser — deterministic spell target.
# Protocol path: Cast, CastingTimeOptionsReq, SelectTargetsReq, CastingTimeOption, CounterAdded, and Counter.
# Paired with: blight-bogslither-no-creature.pzl
[metadata]
Name:Bogslither's Embrace Blight
Goal:Win
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Choose Blight 1, put a -1/-1 counter on Grizzly Bears, and exile Centaur Courser.

